-- s 197(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 197(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 197(1) do a thing, cause a thing to be done or engage in a course of conduct for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 197(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 197(1A) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance knowingly or recklessly
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 197(1A) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance knowingly or recklessly` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 197(1A) do a thing that creates, or is likely to create, a false or misleading appearance, knowingly or recklessly` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 197(1A) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance knowingly or recklessly` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 197(2) a person must not maintain, inflate or depress the market price by a sale with no change in beneficial ownership or a fictitious transaction
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 197(2) a person must not maintain, inflate or depress the market price by a sale with no change in beneficial ownership or a fictitious transaction` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 197(2) maintain, inflate, depress or cause fluctuations in the market price of capital markets products by a purchase or sale with no change in beneficial ownership, or by a fictitious transaction or device` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 197(2) a person must not maintain, inflate or depress the market price by a sale with no change in beneficial ownership or a fictitious transaction` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 198(1) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a corporation's securities with the intent to induce others to deal
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 198(1) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a corporation's securities with the intent to induce others to deal` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 198(1) effect, take part in or carry out 2 or more transactions in securities of a corporation with the intent to induce others to subscribe for, purchase or sell` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 198(1) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a corporation's securities with the intent to induce others to deal` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 198(2) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a business trust's securities with the intent to induce others to deal
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 198(2) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a business trust's securities with the intent to induce others to deal` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 198(2) effect, take part in or carry out 2 or more transactions in securities of a business trust with the intent to induce others to subscribe for, purchase or sell` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 198(2) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a business trust's securities with the intent to induce others to deal` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 199 a person must not make a false or misleading statement likely to induce dealing or move the price
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 199 a person must not make a false or misleading statement likely to induce dealing or move the price` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 199 make a statement, or disseminate information, that is false or misleading in a material particular` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 199 a person must not make a false or misleading statement likely to induce dealing or move the price` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 200(1) a person must not fraudulently induce another person to deal in capital markets products
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 200(1) a person must not fraudulently induce another person to deal in capital markets products` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 200(1) induce or attempt to induce another person to deal in capital markets products by a misleading, false or deceptive statement, a dishonest concealment, or false recorded information` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 200(1) a person must not fraudulently induce another person to deal in capital markets products` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 201 a person must not employ a manipulative or deceptive device in connection with a subscription, purchase or sale
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 201 a person must not employ a manipulative or deceptive device in connection with a subscription, purchase or sale` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 201 employ a device or practice to defraud, make a statement known to be false, or omit a material fact, in connection with the subscription, purchase or sale of capital markets products` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 201 a person must not employ a manipulative or deceptive device in connection with a subscription, purchase or sale` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 201A(1) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a derivatives contract without effecting it in good faith
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 201A(1) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a derivatives contract without effecting it in good faith` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 201A(1) knowingly execute, or hold out as executed, an order for a derivatives contract without having effected a purchase or sale in good faith` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 201A(1) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a derivatives contract without effecting it in good faith` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 201A(2) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a spot foreign exchange contract without effecting it in good faith
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 201A(2) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a spot foreign exchange contract without effecting it in good faith` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 201A(2) knowingly execute, or hold out as executed, an order for a spot foreign exchange contract without having effected a purchase or sale in good faith` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 201A(2) a person must not knowingly execute an order for a spot foreign exchange contract without effecting it in good faith` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 201B a person must not manipulate the price of a derivatives contract or its underlying thing, or corner an underlying thing
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 201B a person must not manipulate the price of a derivatives contract or its underlying thing, or corner an underlying thing` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 201B manipulate or attempt to manipulate the price of a derivatives contract or its underlying thing, or corner or attempt to corner an underlying thing` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 201B a person must not manipulate the price of a derivatives contract or its underlying thing, or corner an underlying thing` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 202(1) a person must not circulate a statement or information about the price effect of an illegal transaction
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 202(1) a person must not circulate a statement or information about the price effect of an illegal transaction` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 202 circulate or disseminate a statement or information about the price effect of an illegal transaction` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 202(1) a person must not circulate a statement or information about the price effect of an illegal transaction` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 203(1) the person to whom subsection (1) applies must notify the approved exchange of the information it requires to be disclosed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 203(1) the person to whom subsection (1) applies must notify the approved exchange of the information it requires to be disclosed` 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (`A corporation` "the person to whom section 203(1) applies") DOES `s 203(1) notify the approved exchange of the information required to be disclosed` AT 30
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 203(1) the person to whom subsection (1) applies must notify the approved exchange of the information it requires to be disclosed` 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 31)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 203(1) the person to whom subsection (1) applies must notify the approved exchange of the information it requires to be disclosed` 30 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 29)
